WEBVTT

00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:10.100
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v><b> Valencia – the best city in the world</b>

00:00:11.884 --> 00:00:18.940
According to recent surveys, Valencia, in Spain, was voted the best city to live in.

00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:28.140
Valencia is situated on the east coast of Spain, about 350 kilometres south of Barcelona.

00:00:28.905 --> 00:00:36.620
It is a large city, the third biggest city in Spain after Madrid and Barcelona,

00:00:37.302 --> 00:00:41.700
with a population of 837,000 people.

00:00:43.124 --> 00:00:50.080
Valencia is famous for its beautiful beaches and also for its historic city centre.

00:00:51.411 --> 00:00:55.340
In the old city, there’s a thirteenth-century cathedral,

00:00:55.809 --> 00:00:58.120
and many other impressive buildings,

00:00:58.524 --> 00:01:06.100
for example, the wonderful central market, and the town hall.

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:14.900
Valencia also has some famous modern buildings designed by architect Santiago Calatrava,

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:21.340
which include the opera house, the science museum, and the aquarium.

00:01:22.860 --> 00:01:28.860
It’s also famous for the <i>Fallas</i> celebrations, which take place in March every year.

00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:34.020
Come and see why it’s such a good place to visit!